Id: swd001w
Severity: WARN
Category: packages
Check: check_software
Fix: chown root:admin and chmod go-w the application (or brew's Cellar entry).
References: chmod(1); brew(1)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-5; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

An application or a brew Cellar entry is writable past root.
Anyone who can write it plants code someone else runs. Take
it out of the writable state.
